---
import LogoCarousel from './LogoCarousel.astro';
---

<section id="sobre" class="about page-gutters" aria-labelledby="about-title">
	<div class="about__container container">
		<figure class="about__portrait">
			<div class="about__photo">
				<img src="/images/giulia-about.png" alt="Retrato de Giulia, com cabelos escuros, óculos e blusa preta." width="768" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
			</div>
			<figcaption class="about__signature">
				<span class="about__name">Giulia</span>
				<span class="about__pointer" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/about-pointer.svg" alt="" width="15.5117" height="15.1156" /></span>
			</figcaption>
		</figure>
		<div class="about__content">
			<h2 id="about-title"><span class="about__title-line">Entre o visual</span> <span class="about__title-line">e o funcional,</span> <span class="about__title-line">eu prefiro os dois.</span></h2>
			<p class="about__description">Minha trajetória passa por branding, social media, web design e UX/UI. Hoje, desenvolvo sites, landing pages e experiências digitais pensando em usabilidade, hierarquia, responsividade, prototipação e direção visual. Gosto de unir raciocínio de produto ao repertório criativo para construir soluções que façam sentido para quem usa e, ao mesmo tempo, tenham identidade.</p>
			<div class="about__logos"><LogoCarousel /></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about {
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		letter-spacing: 0;
		background: transparent;
	}
	.about__container {
		min-inline-size: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: var(--about-content-gap);
		padding-block: var(--section-padding-y);
	}
	.about__portrait {
		position: relative;
		flex: none;
		/* A assinatura avança 18px além da foto, como no Figma. */
		inline-size: min(349px, calc(100% - 18px));
		aspect-ratio: 349 / 451;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.about__photo {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		overflow: hidden;
		border-radius: var(--radius-40);
	}
	.about__photo::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		border: var(--border-width-1) solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-sand) 42%, transparent);
		border-radius: inherit;
		pointer-events: none;
	}
	.about__photo > img {
		inline-size: 100%;
		block-size: 100%;
		/* O asset exportado já contém o enquadramento; mesma geometria do contexto. */
		object-fit: fill;
		object-position: bottom;
	}
	.about__signature {
		position: absolute;
		inset-inline-end: -18px;
		inset-block-start: calc(100% * 349 / 451);
	}
	.about__name {
		display: block;
		padding: 5px 10px;
		border-radius: var(--radius-full);
		background: var(--color-sand-light);
		color: var(--color-text-inverse);
		font-size: var(--font-size-15);
		font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular);
		line-height: 19px;
	}
	.about__pointer {
		position: absolute;
		inset-inline-start: -7.6473388671875px;
		inset-block-start: -10px;
		inline-size: 21.957683563232422px;
		block-size: 20.557741165161133px;
		transform: rotate(18deg);
		transform-origin: 0 0;
	}
	.about__pointer img {
		position: absolute;
		inset-block-start: 1.66%;
		inset-inline-start: 5.49%;
		max-inline-size: none;
	}
	.about__content {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: var(--space-20);
		inline-size: 100%;
		min-inline-size: 0;
	}
	p, h2 { margin: 0; }
	h2 {
		inline-size: 720px;
		max-inline-size: 100%;
		font-size: var(--font-size-heading-large);
		font-weight: var(--font-weight-extra-bold);
		line-height: var(--line-height-38);
		overflow-wrap: break-word;
	}
	@media (width < 768px) {
		.about__title-line {
			display: block;
			white-space: nowrap;
		}
	}
	.about__description {
		inline-size: 690px;
		max-inline-size: 100%;
		font-size: var(--font-size-16);
		font-weight: var(--font-weight-regular);
		line-height: var(--line-height-25);
	}
	.about__logos { inline-size: 100%; min-inline-size: 0; margin-block-start: var(--space-12); }
	/* Adaptações provisórias: limites já adotados em global.css. */
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.about__container { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; }
		.about__portrait { inline-size: min(349px, 32%); }
		.about__content { flex: 1; }
	}
	@media (min-width: 1280px) {
		.about__container { padding-block-end: var(--space-64); }
		.about__portrait { inline-size: 349px; }
		.about__description { inline-size: 100%; }
		h2 { line-height: var(--line-height-54); }
	}
</style>
